---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

---
<Base title="AI Receptionist" description="An AI receptionist for businesses of every size: answers inbound calls 24/7 on a dedicated number, books appointments and delivers messages with transcripts." current="services">
<section aria-labelledby="h1" style="padding:clamp(32px,4vw,48px) 0 clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px)">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px)">
<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:clamp(32px,5vw,64px)"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:16px;color:#585E5A">chevron_right</span><a href="/services">Services</a><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:16px;color:#585E5A">chevron_right</span><span aria-current="page" style="color:#585E5A">AI Receptionist</span></nav>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,420px),1fr));gap:clamp(40px,6vw,80px);align-items:center">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px">
<p style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1D6B60"><span style="width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:8px;background:#D5EDE3;color:#0F6B57;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px;color:#0F6B57">call</span></span>AI service</p>
<h1 id="h1" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,48px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.025em">AI Receptionist</h1>
<p style="font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(20px,2vw,24px);line-height:1.35;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#0F4C45;text-wrap:balance">Every call answered, every caller helped — even at 2 a.m.</p>
<p style="font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,19px);line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;max-width:58ch">The HazirMinds AI Receptionist answers inbound calls on a dedicated business number, day and night. It handles inquiries, books appointments, and delivers messages with a transcript and callback details. It's built for businesses of every size that can't pick up every call, and every call shows up in your dashboard.</p>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:8px">
<a class="x1" href="/book-a-discovery-call" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:52px;padding:0 28px;border-radius:999px;background:#0F4C45;color:#FAF7F2;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;text-decoration:none;transition:background .15s,box-shadow .15s">Book a Discovery Call</a>
<a class="x2" href="#try" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:52px;padding:0 28px;border-radius:999px;border:1.5px solid #0F4C45;color:#0F4C45;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;text-decoration:none;transition:background .15s">Estimate missed calls</a>
</div>
</div>

<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 24px 64px rgba(15,76,69,.10),0 2px 6px rgba(26,33,31,.05);overflow:hidden">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #DED5C6;background:#F5F1EA"><span style="width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#DED5C6"></span><span style="width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#DED5C6"></span><span style="width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#DED5C6"></span><span style="font-size:13px;color:#585E5A;margin-left:12px">Calls</span><span style="flex:1"></span><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:24px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#F7ECD6;color:#7A4E00;font-weight:600;font-size:12px">Sample data</span></div>
<div style="padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px"><span style="width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:#E3EDE9;color:#0F4C45;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px">call</span></span><div style="flex:1;min-width:0"><b style="font-size:17px">Dana R.</b><p style="font-size:14px;color:#585E5A">Inbound · 2:14 a.m. · after hours</p></div><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;height:28px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#E5F0E8;color:#1E6B3E;font-weight:600;font-size:13px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:16px">check</span>Answered</span></div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5">
<p style="font-weight:600;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#585E5A">Transcript</p>
<div style="align-self:flex-start;max-width:88%;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:12px 12px 12px 4px;background:#E3EDE9;color:#1A211F"><b style="font-size:13px;color:#0F4C45">AI</b><br>Hi, you've reached Oakline Home Services. I'm an AI assistant, and this call may be recorded and transcribed. How can I help?</div>
<div style="align-self:flex-end;max-width:80%;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:12px 12px 4px 12px;background:#F5F1EA"><b style="font-size:13px;color:#585E5A">Caller</b><br>Our water heater stopped working. Can someone come out Thursday morning?</div>
<div style="align-self:flex-start;max-width:88%;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:12px 12px 12px 4px;background:#E3EDE9"><b style="font-size:13px;color:#0F4C45">AI</b><br>I can book Thursday morning for you. Can I take your name and the best number to reach you?</div>
</div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(160px,1fr));gap:12px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #EEE8DE">
<div style="display:flex;gap:10px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:22px;color:#0F4C45">event_available</span><div><b style="font-size:14px">Appointment booked</b><p style="font-size:13px;color:#585E5A">Thursday morning</p></div></div>
<div style="display:flex;gap:10px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:22px;color:#0F4C45">contact_phone</span><div><b style="font-size:14px">Callback details</b><p style="font-size:13px;color:#585E5A">Sent to your team</p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="ps-h" style="background:#E8F2EE;padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px)">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:48px"><h2 id="ps-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Problems it solves</h2><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Three everyday problems the AI Receptionist takes off your plate.</p></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,300px),1fr));gap:24px">
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px;padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#585E5A">The problem</p><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:24px;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">Missed calls or slow replies</h3><div style="height:1px;background:#DED5C6"></div><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1D6B60">What changes</p><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">The AI Receptionist answers instantly, 24/7.</p></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px;padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#585E5A">The problem</p><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:24px;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">Manual scheduling back-and-forth</h3><div style="height:1px;background:#DED5C6"></div><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1D6B60">What changes</p><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">The AI books appointments directly.</p></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px;padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#585E5A">The problem</p><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:24px;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">The owner is doing everything</h3><div style="height:1px;background:#DED5C6"></div><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1D6B60">What changes</p><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">The AI handles repetitive front-line calls, freeing the owner's time.</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="get-h" style="padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,380px),1fr));gap:clamp(32px,5vw,64px);align-items:start">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><h2 id="get-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em">What you get</h2><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;max-width:44ch">Everything in the standard AI Receptionist service.</p></div>
<ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,260px),1fr));gap:16px">
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:24px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px"><span style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:#D5EDE3;color:#0F6B57;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#0F6B57">dialpad</span></span><div><b style="font-size:17px">A dedicated business number</b><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#585E5A;margin-top:4px">Callers reach your AI Receptionist on a number set up just for your business.</p></div></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:24px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px"><span style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:#D5EDE3;color:#0F6B57;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#0F6B57">support_agent</span></span><div><b style="font-size:17px">Calls answered 24/7</b><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#585E5A;margin-top:4px">It answers inbound calls and handles inquiries, day or night.</p></div></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:24px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px"><span style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:#D5EDE3;color:#0F6B57;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#0F6B57">event_available</span></span><div><b style="font-size:17px">Appointments booked directly</b><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#585E5A;margin-top:4px">Booking is part of the standard service.</p></div></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:24px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px"><span style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:#D5EDE3;color:#0F6B57;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#0F6B57">description</span></span><div><b style="font-size:17px">Messages with transcripts</b><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#585E5A;margin-top:4px">Every message arrives with a transcript and callback details.</p></div></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:24px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px"><span style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:#D5EDE3;color:#0F6B57;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#0F6B57">space_dashboard</span></span><div><b style="font-size:17px">Call activity in your dashboard</b><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#585E5A;margin-top:4px">See every call in your admin dashboard.</p></div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="how-h" style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6;padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px)">
<h2 id="how-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:48px">How it works</h2>
<ol style="list-style:none;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,240px),1fr));gap:24px">
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding-top:24px;border-top:2px solid #2B5C8F"><span style="font-weight:700;font-size:15px;color:#2B5C8F">Step 1</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3">We learn how you handle calls</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Your common questions, booking rules, and who should get which messages.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding-top:24px;border-top:2px solid #8A5A00"><span style="font-weight:700;font-size:15px;color:#8A5A00">Step 2</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3">We set it up with your approved knowledge</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Your dedicated number, your answers and your rules. Nothing else.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding-top:24px;border-top:2px solid #A23E1E"><span style="font-weight:700;font-size:15px;color:#A23E1E">Step 3</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3">It answers your calls</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">It introduces itself as an AI, then answers, books or takes a message within your rules.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding-top:24px;border-top:2px solid #0F6B57"><span style="font-weight:700;font-size:15px;color:#0F6B57">Step 4</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3">You review, we refine</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">You see calls and transcripts in your dashboard. We measure the results and adjust with you.</p></li>
</ol>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="lane-h" style="background:#0F4C45;color:#FAF7F2;padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,380px),1fr));gap:clamp(32px,5vw,64px);align-items:start">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#DCE7E4">AI governance</p><h2 id="lane-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em">How the AI stays in its lane</h2><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#DCE7E4;max-width:44ch">The same rules apply to every call, for every client.</p><a href="/security" style="color:#FAF7F2;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;margin-top:8px">Security &amp; data protection →</a></div>
<ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column">
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2)"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#D6A552">record_voice_over</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.55">It introduces itself as an AI at the start of every call.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2)"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#D6A552">menu_book</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.55">It answers only from your approved knowledge. It does not invent answers.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2)"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#D6A552">rule</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.55">It books and takes messages only within the permissions and workflows you set.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2)"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#D6A552">support_agent</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.55">When it's unsure, it says so and routes the caller to a person on your team.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2)"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#D6A552">phone_callback</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.55">It answers inbound calls only. It never makes unsolicited calls or texts.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2)"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#D6A552">lock</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.55">Recordings and transcripts stay in your own isolated environment.</p></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="inc-h" style="padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px)">
<h2 id="inc-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:48px">Included vs. scoped separately</h2>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,380px),1fr));gap:24px">
<div style="background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #0F4C45;border-radius:16px;padding:clamp(24px,3vw,40px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#0F4C45">check_circle</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:24px;line-height:1.3">Included in the standard service</h3></div>
<ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5">
<li style="display:flex;gap:10px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px;color:#0F4C45">check</span>A dedicated business number</li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:10px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px;color:#0F4C45">check</span>Inbound calls answered 24/7</li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:10px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px;color:#0F4C45">check</span>Appointment booking</li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:10px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px;color:#0F4C45">check</span>Messages with transcript and callback details</li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:10px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px;color:#0F4C45">check</span>Call activity in your admin dashboard</li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:10px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px;color:#0F4C45">check</span>Managed hosting with monitoring, maintenance and updates</li>
</ul>
<p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#585E5A;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #DED5C6">No setup fee for standard services. Usage, such as voice minutes and AI processing, is billed at actual provider cost with no markup.</p>
</div>
<div style="background:#F0EAE0;border-radius:16px;padding:clamp(24px,3vw,40px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#585E5A">tune</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:24px;line-height:1.3">Scoped and quoted separately</h3></div>
<ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5">
<li style="display:flex;gap:10px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px;color:#585E5A">add</span>Custom integrations with your existing business systems</li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:10px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px;color:#585E5A">add</span>Advanced automation and workflow redesign</li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:10px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px;color:#585E5A">add</span>Self-hosted setups on your own server</li>
</ul>
<p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#585E5A;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #DED5C6;margin-top:auto">A setup fee applies only when customization is required. <a href="/pricing">How pricing works</a></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="try" aria-labelledby="try-h" style="padding:0 0 clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px);scroll-margin-top:80px">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px)">
<a class="x3" href="/#try" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,320px),1fr));gap:32px;align-items:center;padding:clamp(28px,4vw,48px);background:#E3EDE9;border-radius:16px;text-decoration:none;color:#1A211F;transition:box-shadow .15s">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0F4C45">Try it</p><h2 id="try-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(24px,2.6vw,32px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Estimate what missed calls cost you</h2><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Enter your own numbers and see the formula behind the estimate.</p><span style="font-weight:600;font-size:16px;color:#0F4C45;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px">Open the missed-call estimator →</span></div>
